@startgantt
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Planificación temporal del proyecto FisioAgenda (diagrama de Gantt)
language es
printscale weekly
Project starts 2026-08-03
saturday are closed
sunday are closed

-- Fase 1. Inicio --
[Análisis del problema y estudio de mercado] as [T1] lasts 4 days
[Requisitos funcionales y no funcionales] as [T2] lasts 3 days
[T2] starts at [T1]'s end
[Selección de tecnologías y entorno] as [T3] lasts 3 days
[T3] starts at [T2]'s end

-- Fase 2. Diseño --
[Wireframes de la interfaz] as [T4] lasts 3 days
[T4] starts at [T3]'s end
[Modelo E/R y casos de uso] as [T5] lasts 4 days
[T5] starts at [T3]'s end
[Arquitectura y diagrama de clases] as [T6] lasts 3 days
[T6] starts at [T5]'s end
[Hito: diseño aprobado] happens at [T6]'s end

-- Fase 3. Desarrollo (sprints semanales) --
[Sprint 1: BD, DAO y seguridad] as [S1] lasts 5 days
[S1] starts at [T6]'s end
[Sprint 2: servicios, login y pacientes] as [S2] lasts 5 days
[S2] starts at [S1]'s end
[Sprint 3: agenda, citas y huecos libres] as [S3] lasts 5 days
[S3] starts at [S2]'s end
[Sprint 4: historial, usuarios, inicio y animaciones] as [S4] lasts 5 days
[S4] starts at [S3]'s end
[Hito: prototipo funcional] happens at [S4]'s end

-- Fase 4. Fase final --
[Pruebas unitarias, de integración y funcionales] as [P1] lasts 5 days
[P1] starts at [S4]'s end
[Corrección de errores] as [P2] lasts 3 days
[P2] starts at [P1]'s start
[P2] starts 2 days after [P1]'s start
[Memoria, manuales y presentación] as [D1] lasts 5 days
[D1] starts at [P1]'s end
[Hito: entrega] happens at [D1]'s end
@endgantt
